Quality-harness finding
-----------------------
Before the harness fix in this change, the HEVC case failed on this device
with SSIM=0.978923 PSNR=26.056069 for both the 8.1.2 artifact (3e0eaf75...)
and the 9.0.2 artifact, byte-identical metrics. c2.exynos.hevc.encoder tags
its output BT.709 limited range while the fixture is untagged, so the host
filter graph inserted a colorspace conversion before ssim/psnr. Comparing raw
samples (setparams with identical tags on both inputs) gives
SSIM=0.999329 PSNR=55.501051 dB. Aligned 1280x720 input and software decode
gave the same pre-fix numbers, ruling out stride and the decoder path.

